Z||000000||Slammed Fiero||05-01-2001||08:46 PM||||<BR>  Just imagine , you , in your teens early 20's , crusing around with your teenage Girlfriend in your nice shiney pooh brown late 70's Porsche 928. The car is an auto , and you have done some home exhaust work , you added a boom tube exhaust tip and the car is loud, a decal that says "porsche Racing" , you have a stereo with more bass than anything else , and you think your the fastest thing on the street.<P>Your crusing around and stop at a light when an unsuspecting mid 90's Caprice wagon pulls up next to you, it sounds rather quiet and except for some 17" Impala SS rims and grill , it looks stock. You just sooo darn cool you make a comment<P>"That Mommies Hotrod?"<P>you and your girlfriend both have a chuckle , while the driver of the wagon has a grin come over him , much like the one in the grinch who stole christmas.<P>You decide to egg the teenage looking (I'm 23 but look 18)driver on by reving your 4 cam 32 vavle late 70's  V8 , The light turns green and you take off...<P><BR>But wait ..the wagon is besdie you<P>pulling away<P>Infornt of you by 1 car length <BR>2 car lengths..<P>The driver of the wagon shuts it down , you turn off in disgust of your german slot car... Some kid in a hot rod station wagon just handed you your ass on a plate, There was no way to tell except for when the docile idle gave away to a loud roar at wide open throttle ,by the Time you heard the LT1 with LT4 heads (GM factory perf Kit) at it's full potential , it was too late , the wagon was a flash of woodgrain , and you were beaten like a rented mule...<P><BR>hehehe.. I love when I get Dads car to "move" so many unsuspecting kids in so many cars  ..so little time...<P>Too bad I have to give it back on Friday<P>94 Impala SS-izd Caprice wagon<BR>Lowered with Eibach springs<BR>Police sway bars<BR>ROH /Impala Knock off wheels<BR>255/50/17 BFG Comp TA ZR's<BR>Full Stainless Dual exhaust , Dynomax ultraflows<BR>Random Tech cats<BR>BBK Throttle body<BR>AS&M adjustable fuel press regulator<BR>Hypertech power programmer<BR>Poly end links on sway bars.<BR>New tranny with heavy duty servo's , casing , higher stall<P><BR>2.78 rear gears (eww) have 3.42's Driven Winter and summer<P><BR>JM||||reg||1
