Z||000027||Slammed Fiero||05-10-2001||11:09 PM||||I just got it today.<P>My dad had the rear resonators taken off the Wagon and replaced with straight pipes. There must be quite a bit of power hiding int he exhaust. It rumbes at idle and is more responsive.<P>Damm I want a V8... or just more power!!<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
